1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,640
And their words seemed to them as idle tales,

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,821
and they believed them not.

3
00:00:02,861 --> 00:00:05,201
Why seek ye the living among the dead?

4
00:00:05,221 --> 00:00:06,682
He is not here, but is risen: remember how

5
00:00:06,742 --> 00:00:09,062
he spake unto you when he was yet in Galilee,

6
00:00:09,082 --> 00:00:10,242
Saying, The Son of man must be delivered into

7
00:00:10,302 --> 00:00:11,923
the hands of sinful men, and be crucified,

8
00:00:11,943 --> 00:00:13,243
and the third day rise again.
